summary.label:
Fono Lógico (previously Spanish Artik) provides over 450 carefully selected images to help Spanish speaking children practice their sounds. Many children with difficulties pronouncing a sound would benefit from using this app. Fono Lógico is now compatible with the Therapy Report Center ( a free app by Smarty Ears)

Fono Lógico Pro includes all consonant in the Spanish language! Speech Therapists and parents are able to select the specific sound they would like to work on, record student’s voices, and save data over time.Fono Lógico is a valuable tool for Speech therapists and parents.It provides accuracy scores for each practice session and allows you to save it for you overtime. Fono Lógico also displays which specific sounds/words were not produced correctly – this is a great way to prepare homework assignments.

With Fono Lógico, speech therapists move to the next level of data tracking because there is no need to count errors on paper- we will do it for you.

Fono Lógico includes the following features:

1. Add students and keeps data overtime;
2. Over 450 built-in images;
3. Ability to use the app on a one on one therapy session or multiple students;
4. Built-in voice recording capabilities;
5. E-mail or print the report cards;
6. Includes  the following sounds: b, ch, d, f, g, j, k, l, m, n, p, r-flp, r-trill, s, t, w, x.
7. Isolate sounds by initial, medial, and final position.
8. Word and Phrase Level
9. Three activities

Developed and designed by: Barbara Fernandes Trilingual M.S;CCC-SLP
